WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.245
Hello. I am Florence, your AI helper.

00:00:03.595 --> 00:00:11.019
Welcome to Eco Town. It is a small town beside a river, and today you will plan it with me, one place at a time.

00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:18.331
In every place, you tap a word to finish a sentence. Then you ask me to suggest plans.

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:25.066
I suggest three plans. Then you press the big button to test them all in the town.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:28.836
You watch what happens to every plan.

00:00:30.686 --> 00:00:36.233
Then you look at what happened, and you choose the plan you think is best. After that, you build it.

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.603
First, Land. Heavy rain is coming. Where should the homes go?

00:00:43.453 --> 00:00:47.954
Second, Getting around. Draw the paths, so that people can walk to the shops.

00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:53.985
Third, Homes. Build a home that keeps your family warm all winter.

00:00:55.835 --> 00:00:59.953
Fourth, Food. Grow fresh food for the market, even when it snows.

00:01:01.803 --> 00:01:05.216
Fifth, Power. Keep the lights on through a long winter night.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.605
Sixth, School. Walk with your friends to school.

00:01:11.455 --> 00:01:17.343
Every place you plan becomes part of your town. When all six are planned, the whole town lights up.

00:01:17.693 --> 00:01:21.170
Press the Eco Town card to begin. I will see you there.
